    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d835">

                <pb facs="0984" n="904" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg904"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The King of Portugal to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Villa Vicosa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have just heard of accident. I express to you my full sympathy and most sincere
                    wishes for your complete recovery.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">The King of Portugal.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
